Where do we live?
Because of the crisis they decided to buy only small T-shirts, because it's less fabric and they're cheaper?
Well, that's a trifle compared to what was happening on the day of the race.
Apart from the fact that it had to go very soon for the chip and the queue for it lasted more than 15 minutes, he still had to hand over a backpack.
